  {
    "id": "1936264113317155210",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "大模型可能会带来另一个问题“认知卸载”，也就是在信息的冲击下失去了思考欲望，把所有的思考过程给外包了。我感觉这是MIT这篇文章中的“认知负债”就是“认知卸载”。",
    "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:25:13.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 1,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1936264115510821032",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "过载与卸载这两者，可能就是一个更本质问题的一体两面，就是对知识消化能力不足导致的。帮助孩子应对这种挑战，是现代教育的根本使命。",
    "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:25:13.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1936264108313395497",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "对此，我自己的解读就是：通过AI, 我们能够快速地获得信息，但是却无法将其内化，导致的消化不良。\n\n这种现象应该一直都有，只不过互联网时代被放大，到了AI时代更甚。",
    "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:25:12.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1936264110586613947",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "之前有一种说法，叫作“认知过载”，也就是说知道的多，但却给自己制造了过大的负荷，难以承受。这种心理体验我曾经经历过，极度痛苦。我花了很多年把这些负荷给消化掉，似乎整个世界都变得简单了一些。\n\n我认为这种“认知过载”也是一种“认知债务”。",
    "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:25:12.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1936264105259929718",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "具体的临床表现就是：\n- 批判性探究能力下降、\n- 更容易被操纵、\n- 创造力减弱、\n- 对想法缺乏所有权 https://t.co/Q3LLpP2V0n",
    "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:25:11.000Z",
